WEBVTT

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:21.250
TONIGHT,
I SHALL HELP MYSELF TO THE ROSE HIP RUBY.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.880
Hmph! Lapin can try all she wants,
but nobody is slipping past all of this security.

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:36.540
Get outside!

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:40.580
Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.170
The Phantom Thief Lapin is here!

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.460
I've already helped myself to the Rose Hip Ruby!

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:54.210
Arrest her!

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:56.960
Hurry!

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:59.170
Get moving!

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.920
Royal Straight...

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.670
Flush!

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.920
I've been struck by an angel...

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:16.830
I'm afraid your hearts all belong to me now, gentlemen.

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:22.040
There is nothing that I cannot steal!

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:25.210
Now, I bid you all adieu!

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:33.580
Get back here, Lapin!

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:34.830
Once again, our hearts have been stolen
by none other than Lapin!

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:37.380
Ah, you beautiful Phantom Thief...

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.880
Where will you make an appearance next time?

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:46.910
Another great episode of Phantom Thief Lapin this week!

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:50.170
She can even steal things that aren't physical.

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:52.670
I forgot about my homework!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:56.210
Curse you, Lapin! I can't believe you stole my time!

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.970
You reap what you sow...

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:03.970
The Case of
the Childhood Friend's Stolen Heart

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:09.000
Spin around with a twirl, hey, dance dance

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.080
In the heavenly cafeteria, dance dance

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.750
Where is the door? (Over here!)

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:18.420
Take a hop into the cup (Leap right in!)

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.580
Big puffy clouds float through the sky

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:24.960
They actually taste sweet, for real (Just kidding!)

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:28.080
If we fly through the sky in tea cups and coffee cups

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:31.210
We can go anywhere together

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:37.290
Wanting to be a dreamer forever (More impossible than possible)

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:43.330
Think about how exciting tomorrow will be (So many flavors to try!)

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:45.920
Cinnamon instead of sugar

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.790
If that becomes a preference, it might be time for evolution

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:53.170
Going to a new place (Were you invited?)

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:56.210
If you get invited there, let's take the plunge and fly

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:59.210
(C'mon ride in the tea cup and soar through the sky)

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.420
(C'mon ride in the coffee cup, yeah yeah)

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:05.170
Spin around with a twirl, hey, dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:08.460
In the heavenly cafeteria, dance dance (Dance dance)

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:12.130
Where is the door? It's inside of the cup

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.710
An illusion? Or reality? Which?

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:18.080
It doesn't really matter either way (Good point)

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:21.080
A dollop of whip cream on your head (Fluff fluff)

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:27.210
Okay, just dance (The future) it'll definitely be fun (So let's fly!)

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.710
Flying through the sky in tea cups and coffee cups

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:33.830
We can go anywhere together!

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:44.620
Phantom Thief Lapin

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.290
I'm glad I managed to borrow a copy...

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.500
but I forgot I don't have a TV.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.560
Say, Syaro...

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:55.060
Let's enjoy a bone-chilling horror movie together!

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:57.000
There's nothing to watch it on here.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.960
Then let's tell each other ghost stories!

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.380
I don't feel like it.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.670
Then let's walk through a spooooky forest.

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:07.210
Why do you have to be so persistent day in and day out?

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:09.810
You never used to be such a coward.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.630
My answer to your invites has always been no!

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.080
Team Beans has arrived at the target.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:18.270
Roger. Then begin phase 2.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:21.400
Alright! Time to strike fear in some hearts!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.080
Commence: Operation Spook!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.150
Yes, sir!

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:27.250
What are you doing in that getup, anyways?

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:32.710
Namu
Amida
Butsu

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:34.000
We're having a horror week at Ama Usa An right now.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.540
Namu
Amida
Butsu

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.500
A curse be upon you...!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.170
Th-that's not gonna scare anybody.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:44.670
I can't believe it was right next to Ama Usa An!

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:49.600
There's a rabbit hutch and vines on the walls.
It fits the description perfectly!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.080
This has gotta be the haunted house
everyone's been talking about!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.130
IT'S MY HOUSE!

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.820
Huh? Syaro?

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:58.060
S-Syaro, behind you!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.580
There's a ghost!

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.210
When exactly did my house...

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.750
become one of the town's paranormal destinations?

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.030
Everybody at school is talking about it!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:15.000
They say the whole area reeks of herbs and wild beasts.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.380
And if you pass in front of the rundown house
during the night,

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:22.170
you can hear the ghastly wail of a young girl's voice.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:28.170
Stop it... no more! Leave that herb alone!

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:30.260
Stoooooop!

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:32.560
That's a rumor going around?

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.500
Oh! But we also came here to extend
an invite to both of you.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:37.630
Huh?

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:42.210
Maya and I are childhood friends,
just like the two of you are.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.240
So we thought it would be fun for the 4 of us to hang out.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:49.490
Yeah, totally! Let's go on an adventure
that we can share together!

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.330
An adventure?

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.000
That sounds like fun!

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.230
What do you say, Syaro?

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:58.710
You wanna go now? Uh...

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.330
I guess if you insist. I'll tag along.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.880
Really? That makes me so happy!

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.960
We got them hook, line, and sinker!

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:29.330
Yeah, it's going smoothly.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.670
You know something, Maya and Megu...

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.700
Wh-what is it?

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:39.920
You two get along just like twins!

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.130
Twins?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.750
But we're polar opposites!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:47.080
The same goes for you two, doesn't it?

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:50.630
Look! Take our hairstyles for example.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.850
Megu and Chiya both have long hair.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.500
But Syaro and I are medium rare!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.470
Why does it sound like you're ordering steak?

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:00.100
We come in totally different sizes, too!

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:03.790
Different sizes... sizes...

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.250
Size...

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:12.080
Listen, Maya! All that matters is if you have a big heart!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:12.920
Huh?

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.700
Yeah! Let's have the biggest hearts out there, Syaro!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.810
I don't get it, but it's nice they're having fun.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:20.880
Right?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.960
Observation Deck

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.790
Okay! I'll explain how this test of courage is gonna work!

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.300
Huh? A test of courage?!

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:33.500
There's a small house up ahead,
so all you have to do is walk past it and come back!

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:35.420
Did I hear "test of courage"?!

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:40.380
Maya and I are going on ahead,
so you two wait a little first and then start, okay?

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:40.960
Okay.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.230
When did this become a test of courage?!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:52.490
This is an adventure, not a test of courage...

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:55.630
The only thing awaiting us is fantasy and romance...

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:58.990
Oh! It sounds like Maya's having fun!

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:04.000
She's only laughing to keep from getting scared.
You should just accept your fate, Syaro.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.630
Excellent, all according to plan.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.550
Get ready for a real surprise, you two!

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:27.670
Oops.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:34.830
I can't land a hit on Chiya at all!

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:37.320
P-please just be rain...

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.210
Huh?

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:43.170
W-waaaaait!

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:45.630
Am I hearing things or was that a girl moaning?

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:47.110
I heard nothing!

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:47.670
B-but..!

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.630
C'mon, hurry up!

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.720
Your hand is wet...

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.790
It's all just your imagination! Keep moving!

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.670
Things are the opposite of how they used to be.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:09.290
I was always the one who led you around
while you cried in fear.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.490
It makes me realize you're not
the same old Syaro anymore.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.320
Obviously!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.210
I have grown up a bit, you know!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:21.910
I'm living with Wild Geese right now.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:26.620
So I'm not nearly as afraid of rabbits as I used to be.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:33.500
I'm more than capable of pulling you
along whenever you feel scared!

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:42.830
Syaro...

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.060
That's true! You're very reliable.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:47.710
You bet I am!

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.750
Leaveeee!

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.130
You must leave this place!

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.750
Be gone!

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.620
Syaro, you let go...

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:58.210
There's ghosts!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:09:59.320
Look!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:07.580
Oh, never mind. It's just some stuffed animals.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.540
Rabbits terrify me!

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:15.960
Wait up!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.080
Syaro!

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:31.630
A curse be upon you!

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:44.080
Wah! A ghos-!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.630
Hey!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.370
Are you okay?

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:50.880
Cocoa...?

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.640
We're sorry for keeping it a secret!

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:01.300
Cocoa planned the whole thing!

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.130
So this was Cocoa's doing?

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:05.880
Yay! Surprise!

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:08.570
Don't give me that.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:11.670
And I can't believe you were in on it, Rize!

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.800
Waiting alone until you showed up
was super scary, so we're even!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:17.290
Actually, where was Chino hiding?

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.380
I never saw her.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:23.270
Tippy told me to leave it all to him.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:24.750
You chickened out.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:25.920
I didn't chicken out.

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:27.130
You must have been so scared!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:30.710
But its okay now because your big sister is here!

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.400
Frankly, you're the most terrifying thing I've seen all night.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:35.210
Ouch!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:39.210
What inspired you to suddenly have this test of courage?

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:43.540
Because you've been upset about Syaro
not hanging out with you lately.

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:47.500
So you did this just for Syaro and I?

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:51.250
My recommendation was for a survival game, though.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:56.170
Cocoa, you're like my soulmate!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:57.670
Aw shucks, it was nothing.

00:11:57.670 --> 00:12:00.570
That was the reason you planned this whole thing?!

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.920
I honestly admire your ability to take the initiative.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:07.920
And I guess it was worthwhile
since Chiya seemed to have fun.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.080
I enjoyed myself quite a bit, too...

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:12.170
Huh?

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:14.210
You liked it too, Syaro?

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:17.580
Wh-what I said was I'm glad that Chiya enjoyed it!

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.330
C'mon, it's getting late. We should go home.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:21.630
Okay!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.330
Syaro, wait up!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.670
Do you think the plan was a success?

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.630
Your face is covered in mud!

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:31.580
So is yours, Syaro.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:32.580
Seriously?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.750
I think it was a huge success!

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:38.580
AMA USA AN

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.710
This feels great.

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:44.490
Thanks so much, Chiya!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.740
Letting you go home looking like that would've

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.520
sparked a whole new set of spooky rumors.

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:52.420
We don't need any more than we already have...

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:59.000
To be honest, I had a sneaking suspicion
about the test of courage being a prank.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:12:59.890
Really?

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:02.510
Then you should have said something, jeez!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:05.040
I know you like scary things, but come on...

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:05.750
That's not it.

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:09.900
All of the horror was just a bonus, what I really wanted

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:13.140
was to have an adventure with you just like the old days.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:19.960
I enjoyed myself so much during the test of courage
I ended up not saying anything.

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:21.780
I'm sorry!

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.040
Chiya...

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:28.080
W-well, I'll have you know the whole thing
was a cake walk for me!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:30.420
Syaro?

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:32.710
So, uh...

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:37.580
I don't mind doing a horror film
marathon tonight, if you want.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.170
I'm so happy for you two!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.080
Thanks for what you did today, Cocoa.

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:47.830
Syaro...!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:53.800
You're actually thanking me instead
of getting mad? Do you have fever?!

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:55.500
Are you sick?!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:14:00.540
WHY CAN'T YOU JUST TAKE MY WORDS
AT FACE VALUE?!

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.790
The Phantom Thief Lapin is here!

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:08.070
There is nothing that I...

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.540
cannot steal!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.130
That's a great imitation!

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:15.040
Wow! It's Lapin!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.310
No treasure ever escapes from me!

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:18.790
From me!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:21.580
Cocoa, you shouldn't play around during work...

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:23.380
Oh, I'm so sorry!

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.630
I promise to play together with you later, Chino!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.290
Th-that's not what I meant!

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:32.540
So, did that Lapin show take off recently or what?

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:33.830
Yes, it's very popular.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:37.390
It has a ton of action, so I think you'd enjoy it too!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:43.270
PHANTOM
THIEF
LAPIN

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.630
The original novel was written
by Miss Aoyama, you know.

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:43.290
Wow! She sure knows how to execute a clean hit!

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:45.530
You mean "produce a smash hit"...

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:50.040
Oh, that reminds me! Don't you think
Lapin looks similar to Syaro?

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:53.080
Maybe Syaro was the model for her design.

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:54.990
Whoa!

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.460
What is it?

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.290
Phantom Thief Lapin!

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:05.580
U-u-um, ah, er...!

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:10.250
Th-there is n-nothing that I c-cannot steal!

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:11.430
Oh. It's just you, Syaro.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:15.080
What's up? Are you pretending to be Lapin, too?

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:15.880
Huh?!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.880
W-well, I...

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:21.290
Sounds like something is afoot!

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:23.330
I'm more than happy to hear you out!

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.000
Cocoa...!

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:26.070
But hold on a second!

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:28.750
Where did you get that mask?!

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.250
I want one, too!

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.130
What happened to hearing me out?!

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:38.710
Actually, Fleur de Lapin is doing
a collaboration with Phantom Thief Lapin right now.

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:42.580
The show is apparently really popular with kids,

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:46.590
Collaboration Campaign!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:46.580
so a bunch of them have been coming to the cafe...

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.790
The magnificent Phantom Thief Lapin is here!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:52.330
Inspector!

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:53.590
So fluffy!

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:57.330
My salesman smile isn't working!

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:01.210
Lapin is supposed to be the star,
but hasn't attracted much attention...

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:04.330
And, uh, I feel kind of responsible for that.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:07.220
W-wait, Lapin has a Lapin collab right now?!

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:09.380
Lapin is at Lapin?!

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:11.960
Lapin in Lapin so pin pin la plain!

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:13.420
Calm yourself down!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:18.330
The reason I was peeking in on Rabbit House
was to watch what Cocoa was doing.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.550
Why me?

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:22.290
You always become fast friends with kids, right?

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.130
Yeah, she totally does.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:27.040
But all I'm doing is acting normal...

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:30.790
You inadvertently find your way
into people's hearts and make them like you.

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.960
I'm so jealous of that talent.

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:35.740
I just enjoy chatting with people!

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.050
And that takes talent!

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.930
You're making too much of it.

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:42.240
You're the Phantom Thief Cocoa, stealer of hearts!

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:46.620
There's no way that Syaro would compliment me
this much without some kind of ulterior motive!

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.610
I'm being totally honest here!

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.460
But listen, Syaro...

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:54.500
You don't have to force yourself
to try and copy what I do.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:55.380
Huh?

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:58.080
I can sense it.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:04.830
What the kids really want isn't some girl dressing up
like Lapin, they want the real Lapin herself!

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:07.080
The real Lapin?

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.960
But then... how am I supposed to make that happen?

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:14.170
You become her! We're gonna turn you
into the real Phantom Thief Lapin!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:19.750
Welcome to the Phantom Thief Lapin viewing party!

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.520
Let's get started!

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:23.290
Viewing party?

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:26.810
If you study Lapin and manage to copy all her mannerisms,

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.270
then the kids will love you for sure!

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:31.710
You need to understand the heart and soul of Lapin as a character

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:34.010
and then make her a part of you.

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:35.670
O-okay, I got it.

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:38.280
This is my first time watching it. I hope I can enjoy it.

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.960
I've only seen some parts of it myself.

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:44.170
But I'm happy to explain whatever I can to you.

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.160
That sounds good!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.750
Okay then, let the show begin!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:48.960
PLAY

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:55.170
Wearing the fragrance of blood and gunpowder,

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:59.050
were a group of men who controlled beasts of iron.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:03.000
The first episode seems really hardcore...

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:04.750
I love stuff like this!

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:08.170
Cocoa, you played the wrong show.

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:21.960
I ended up... putting our kids
through some really lonely times.

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:26.370
But I'm going to catch Lapin no matter what it takes.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:30.880
That gemstone you tried to protect,
the Mellow Blue Tear...

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:34.750
Lapin knows all of the secrets behind it for sure.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.290
Syaro?!

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.420
And even Rize!

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.670
Are the two of you going to be okay?

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:43.040
I-I never imagined the Inspector had that kind of past...

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:47.750
I-I swear to treasure my own wife and children someday!

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.980
You're getting a little too empathetic.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:53.950
I had completely misunderstood Lapin this entire time.

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:56.750
I was even messing up her signature pose.

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:59.580
Can we watch the part where she does
her signature pose one more time?

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:00.990
Of course!

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:04.330
But Syaro, you really don't have to put in so much effort...

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:09.000
I do, because those kids are coming
with dreams of meeting the real Lapin.

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:13.670
That's why I'm going to perfect my Lapin performance
and put smiles on all of their faces!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.580
Syaro...

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:19.110
Nobody can stop Syaro
once she puts her mind to something.

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:22.250
She's always been the type to give things 100%.
So that part goes like this...

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:24.500
And then...

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.560
This is how she throws her cards!

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:33.290
My elbow should be bent at approximately 60 degrees.

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:35.250
And my hand will be at the angle from episode 10!

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.460
That's the most ideal!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.500
The Phantom Thief Lapin...

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.380
...is here!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:44.960
There is nothing that I cannot steal!

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:47.670
You've got it down pat, Syaro!

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:49.710
Yeah, you're a real pro now!

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:51.960
Cocoa, is that supposed to be the Bon Dance?

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.390
No it's not!

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:55.840
You need to double check the angle
you keep your hands at.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.130
Your impression of Lapin is really cool!

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:02.420
I'm sure that all the kids will love it.

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.170
Chino...

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:07.880
Thanks! I'll do my best!

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:11.630
Ah! Chino's heart just got stolen!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.810
The morning sun sure is bright.

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:26.420
I'm still blown away by the backstory
behind all of her extravagant thievery!

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:28.240
The Phantom Thief Lapin...

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:32.000
there's just something about her way of doing things that really enthralls the heart.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.220
Cocoa!

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:35.080
Huh?

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.380
Here. For you.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.330
Lapin's mask?!

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.970
Are you sure I can have this?!

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:42.670
Settle down.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.880
It's totally okay, we have a bunch of these at the cafe.

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:50.520
Thanks so much, Syaro!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:53.290
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:56.420
You were a huge help. Seriously, thanks a lot.

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.380
I'm starting to think...

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:01.080
Huh?

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:05.910
If I take this mask now you're gonna expect
some kind of favor in return...

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:10.950
WHY CAN YOU NEVER JUST BELIEVE WHAT I SAY?!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.500
Nakayoshi da zutto da!
We are friends forever!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.290
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!
Friends! Okay! Friends!

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:18.830
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!
We'll make it happen! There's no problem since it's all okay!

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:22.670
Kono sekai ni wa fushigi ga aru to
"There are mysterious things in this world"

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:26.460
Minareta mado kara osasoi no message
An inviting message from outside the familiar window

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:30.500
Ironna toko e dekakemasen ka?
Would you like to explore different places?

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:34.210
Hai hai tama ni wa bouken mo hitsuyou desu ne
Yeah, yeah, an adventure is needed every now and then

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:38.080
Soshite soshite tooi machikado de kitto
And eventually on some street corner far away

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:42.210
Itsumo no coffee nomitaku naru hazu
We'll get a craving to drink the usual coffee

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:48.210
Hanarete mite wakaru koto ga takusan aru
There are many things to realize if you just take a step back!

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:51.710
Yappari...
Of course...

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:55.540
Ima wa issho ga ii ne zutto issho ga ii ne
Right now being together is best, together forever is best

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:59.330
Kawatteku kisetsu no naka demo
Even amidst the changing seasons

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:03.330
Onaji kimochi de itai minna o daiji ni shitai
I want to keep these feelings, I want to treasure everyone

00:22:03.540 --> 00:22:07.380
Daisuki na basho ga atte yokatta
I'm glad to have a place that I love

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:11.250
Ima wa issho ga ii ne sou da issho ga ii ne
Right now being together is best, that's right, together is best

00:22:11.380 --> 00:22:14.920
Dokoka ittemo chanto modotte kite
Even if you go somewhere else, be sure to come back

00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:17.000
Tsutawatteru ki ga shimasu
I think that feeling is understood

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:22.330
Datte datte hora kyou mo minna ni aemashita
Because, after all, I got to see everyone today

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:28.750
Aitai toki ni aerutte... nakayoshi!
Seeing them whenever I want means... we're friends!

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:32.750
Nakayoshi da zutto da!
We are friends forever!

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:34.290
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!
Friends! Okay! Friends!

00:22:34.670 --> 00:22:38.540
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!
We'll make it happen! There's no problem since it's okay!

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:44.510
Collaboration Campaign!

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:47.170
Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone!

00:22:48.790 --> 00:22:51.130
The Phantom Thief Lapin is here!

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:55.830
There is nothing that I... cannot steal!

00:22:55.830 --> 00:22:58.340
Lapin!

00:22:58.340 --> 00:23:00.980
That's right. It's me, Lapin!

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:04.250
I think I might have finally gotten over my nerves.

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:06.630
Hey Syaro! We came to cheer you on!

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:07.290
Huh?

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:10.740
Be careful kids, that Lapin is an imposter!

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:13.920
The real Lapin is actually right here!

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:15.420
Whoa!
Are you the really real one?

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:16.830
Are you in disguise right now?

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:19.080
Lapin! It's Lapin!

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.750
YOU'RE STEALING MY BUSINESS!

00:23:26.830 --> 00:23:28.670
The Phantom Thief Takahiro is here!

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:30.420
I've helped myself to the next episode preview!

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:33.010
And now the heart of every customer at this bar...

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:35.970
Bunnisode 3: Everything in the World Serves as My Experience Points

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:34.250
belongs to me!

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:35.830
Arrest him!
